# GS Director thermals: Peltier cooler

From **2026-08-13** the 2018 iPad Pro 11" (A12X) used for GS Director runs sits on a **Peltier cooler**.

When reading HUD `thermal=`, `ProcessInfo.thermalState`, time-to-throttle, encode-session refusals, or degradation-tier climbs:

- State that the Peltier was on. Do not treat `fair` as equivalent to earlier cooling-pad or bare-device runs in `mobile/apps/gsDirector/docs/risks.md`.
- Do not claim the A12X has thermal headroom in the field from a cool Peltier session.
- Keep new numbers in a separate series from pre-Peltier measurements.

Historical context: a cooling pad already kept some runs at `fair`; a bare charging device still climbed to `serious`. The Peltier is stronger than that pad.
